      "message": "So from hwui perspective 2) is a bit less work, but it\u0027s not huge amount to worry about(I don\u0027t see big problem in getting vkImage from SkSurface), so I\u0027d look at this from api / maintenance perspective. \n\nFrom maintenance:\nIn 1) will skia always know vkImage at that point? e.g with some future refactoring, might the drawable be called before skia knows vkImage? If so 2) might be a preferable option.\n\nFrom API:\n1) Allows clients do weird things with vkImage, although nothing stops them to get that vkImage from SkSurface. 2) Has a bit weird flag. Both are kinda not great, but not terrible either.",
